<section class="section wrap" id="compare"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Find the right fit</p><h2>Three ways to a fresher space.</h2></div><p>A starting point for your quote. Your written scope confirms the actual work.</p></div><div class="scope-grid"><article class="card"><span class="number">01 / MAINTAIN</span><h3>Regular cleaning</h3><p>For a maintained home, once or on a routine.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Kitchen surfaces & appliance exteriors</li><li>Bathroom fixtures & mirrors</li><li>Accessible dusting</li><li>Vacuuming & mopping</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/book/?service=regular">Book your clean</a></article><article class="card"><span class="number">02 / RESET</span><h3>Deep cleaning</h3><p>For a first visit or a home needing extra attention.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Regular-clean areas</li><li>More time for agreed buildup</li><li>Accessible baseboards & detail</li><li>Priority areas discussed before quoting</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/book/?service=deep">Book your clean</a></article><article class="card"><span class="number">03 / MOVE ON</span><h3>Move-out cleaning</h3><p>For an empty home before key handover.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Kitchen, bathrooms & floors</li><li>Empty cabinet interiors, as agreed</li><li>Appliance interiors, as agreed</li><li>Your handover checklist reviewed</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/book/?service=moveout">Book your clean</a></article></div><details class="scope-extras"><summary>Extras, supplies & exclusions</summary><p>Oven and fridge interiors, interior windows and cabinet interiors must be listed in your quote. Supplies and product preferences are confirmed before the visit. Carpet extraction, heavy lifting, waste removal, hazardous materials and specialist remediation are outside this proposed scope.</p></details></section>